# Code-graph output (regenerable, ~7 MB per repo)
graphify-out/

# Scratch dirs/files left behind by the test runner when TMPDIR is unavailable.
# The random 8-character names are tempfile probe files, not project data.
# Anchored to the repository root on purpose: an unanchored 8-character pattern
# also matches *directories* at any depth, and it silently swallowed
# `cli/commands`, `security`, `settings`, `adapters`, `channels`, `handlers`
# and `pomodoro` out of every wheel built from this tree — 64 modules.
.ptb/
/[0-9a-z][0-9a-z][0-9a-z][0-9a-z][0-9a-z][0-9a-z][0-9a-z][0-9a-z]
